  "instructions": [
    "Peel and dice the calabash squash into 1-inch cubes.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a copper pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger to the pot and saut\u00021 until fragrant.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper to the pot and stir for 1 minute.",
    "Add the calabash squash to the pot and stir to coat with the spice mixture.",
    "Cook for 10-12 minutes, or until the squash is tender and lightly browned.",
    "Drizzle the lemon juice over the squash and stir to combine.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
